### Variables
@baseUrl = https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes
# Replace the value below with your actual API key
@googleKey = blabla

### 1. Basic search test (by keyword)
GET {{baseUrl}}?q=peaky+blinders&key={{googleKey}}

### 2. Search test with limits and filters
# maxResults=5: Limit to 5 results
# langRestrict=en,fr: English and French books only
GET {{baseUrl}}?q=classic+crime+fiction&maxResults=5&langRestrict=en,fr&key={{googleKey}}

### 3. Fetch specific book details via Google ID
# Example with a random ID (replace with a real ID from previous responses)
@bookId = jCd3nQAACAAJ
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{bookId}}?key={{googleKey}}